:RedundancyMode_SINGLE_CHASSIS rdfs:comment "Single chassis redundancy mode: each NNI Bearer in the NNI Group will be connected to the same chassis; the NNI will operate as a single, unprotected interface. [extension: nbn Ethernet Product Module, Section 1.3(d), p.7]" .

:RedundancyMode_DIVERSE_CHASSIS rdfs:comment "Diverse chassis redundancy mode: each NNI Bearer in the NNI Group will be connected across a pair of chassis. [extension: nbn Ethernet Product Module, Section 1.3(e), p.7]" .

# Link the event to the redundancy mode
